## Why This Is Asked
This question tests a harder variant of partition DP where each block's value depends on its range (max-min). It requires careful state design, precomputation of subarray values, and backtracking to output exact k non-overlapping blocks.

## Key Concepts
- 2D DP over prefix index and number of blocks
- Precomputing block values V[l][r] = max - min for all subarrays
- Reconstruction via parent pointers to output endpoints

## Code Example
```javascript
function maxRangeSubarrayValue(A, k) {
  const n = A.length;
  const V = Array.from({ length: n }, () => Array(n).fill(0));
  for (let l = 0; l < n; l++) {
    let mx = -Infinity, mn = Infinity;
    for (let r = l; r < n; r++) {
      mx = Math.max(mx, A[r]);
      mn = Math.min(mn, A[r]);
      V[l][r] = mx - mn;
    }
  }

  const dp = Array.from({ length: n + 1 }, () => Array(k + 1).fill(-Infinity));
  const parent = Array.from({ length: n + 1 }, () => Array(k + 1).fill(-1));
  dp[0][0] = 0;

  for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    for (let t = 1; t <= k; t++) {
      for (let j = 1; j <= i; j++) {
        const val = dp[j - 1][t - 1] + V[j - 1][i - 1];
        if (val > dp[i][t]) {
          dp[i][t] = val;
          parent[i][t] = j;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  const blocks = [];
  let i = n, t = k;
  while (t > 0 && parent[i][t] !== -1) {
    const j = parent[i][t];
    blocks.push([j, i]);
    i = j - 1;
    t--;
  }
  return { value: dp[n][k], blocks: blocks.reverse() };
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
New angle: exactly k non-overlapping subarrays maximize sum, a knapsack-like DP variant with efficient inner maximization. It mirrors budgeted promotion planning.

## Key Concepts
- DP state: dp[i][t] is the best total for first i elements using t blocks
- Prefix sums P enable O(1) subarray sums
- Optimize inner max with best = max(dp[j-1][t-1]-P[j-1]) up to i
- Reconstruction via pointers to endpoints

## Code Example
```javascript
function maxKSubarrays(a,k){
  const n=a.length;
  const P=[0];
  for(let v of a) P.push(P[P.length-1]+v);
  const dp=Array.from({length:n+1},()=>Array(k+1).fill(-Infinity));
  dp[0].fill(0);
  for(let t=1;t<=k;t++){
    let best=-Infinity;
    for(let i=1;i<=n;i++){
      dp[i][t]=dp[i-1][t];
      best=Math.max(best, dp[i-1][t-1]-P[i-1]);
      const cand=P[i]+best;
      if(cand>dp[i][t]) dp[i][t]=cand;
    }
  }
  return dp[n][k];
}
```

